Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column${line.separator}company.default.time.zone=America/Los_Angeles|
		|testray.main.component.name|Calendar|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column${line.separator}company.default.time.zone=America/Los_Angeles|
		|testray.main.component.name|Calendar|
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
		|portletName|Calendar|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	Then Portlet add PG
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
		|portletName|Calendar|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Edit Language Selector And View Event
Priority: 3
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|CalendarLocalization#EditLanguageSelectorAndViewEvent|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
		|portletName|Language|
	And LanguagePortlet select Language PG
		|language|Spanish (Spain)|
	And CalendarScheduler add Localized Event
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event Title|
		|saveButton|Guardar|
		|viewType|Week|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And Alert view Success Message
	And CalendarScheduler view Localized Event
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event Title|
		|viewTypeLocalized|Semana|
	And LanguagePortlet select Language PG
		|language|English (United States)|
	Then CalendarScheduler view Day
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event Title|
Scenario: View Show More Localization
Priority: 3
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When CalendarNavigator goto Add Event
	And CalendarEvent add
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event 1|
		|eventType|All Day|
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarNavigator goto Add Event
	And CalendarEvent add
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event 2|
		|eventType|All Day|
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarNavigator goto Add Event
	And CalendarEvent add
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event 3|
		|eventType|All Day|
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarNavigator goto Add Event
	And CalendarEvent add
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event 4|
		|eventType|All Day|
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarNavigator goto Add Event
	And CalendarEvent add
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event 5|
		|eventType|All Day|
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarNavigator goto Add Event
	And CalendarEvent add
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event 6|
		|eventType|All Day|
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And MyAccount configure Display Settings Language
		|languageName|español (España)|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarScheduler view Show More Localized Via Day View
		|messageLocalized|Mostrar 1 más|
		|viewTypeLocalized|Día|
	And CalendarScheduler view Show More Localized Via Week View
		|messageLocalized|Mostrar 1 más|
		|viewTypeLocalized|Semana|
	And CalendarScheduler view Show More Localized Via Month View
		|messageLocalized|Mostrar 4 más|
		|viewTypeLocalized|Mes|
	Then MyAccount configure Display Settings Language Localized
		|category|Mi cuenta|
		|languageName|English (United States)|
		|portlet|Mi cuenta|
		|saveButton|Guardar|

